    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For those who\u2019ve never found a novel worth reading.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel about disconnected youth drifting through the edges of society \u2014 <br>an atmospheric journey wrapped in the quiet air of \u201cthose days that never quite happened.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike typical visual novels, every scene is presented as a full illustration, <br>with no background music \u2014 only ambient sounds and effects carry the story forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience closes with an original ending theme, <br><i>&quot;After School That Couldn\u2019t Become a Constellation&quot;</i>, sung by 14 characters using Vocaloid technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no branching routes \u2014 just a single linear story. <br>Choices, where they appear, are light-hearted detours that don't affect the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re free to pause, revisit, or walk away. This is a story that respects your pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0 Special Edition Bonus Content:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 desktop wallpapers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100-image bonus CG collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MP3 + extras for the ending theme song <i>&quot;After School That Couldn\u2019t Become a Constellation&quot;</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> Some bonus files are password-protected. <br>Please right-click the ZIP file and select \u201cExtract All\u201d to avoid repeated password prompts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the <strong>Special Edition</strong> with bonus content. <br>A <strong>Standard Edition</strong> (without bonuses) is also available separately.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~800 full-scene illustrations (generated via KlingAI)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices are non-branching, optional side content only</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~300 ambient and sound effect files, no BGM</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ending theme performed by 14 characters using Voisona</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: ~10 hours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Created with:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ren\u2019Py (Engine)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KlingAI (Visuals)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voisona (Voice synthesis)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cakewalk by BandLab (Music)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer:</strong> Shoichi Kirishima</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For those who\u2019ve never found a novel worth reading.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel about disconnected youth drifting through the edges of society \u2014 <br>an atmospheric journey wrapped in the quiet air of \u201cthose days that never quite happened.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike typical visual novels, every scene is presented as a full illustration, <br>with no background music \u2014 only ambient sounds and effects carry the story forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience closes with an original ending theme, <br><i>&quot;After School That Couldn\u2019t Become a Constellation&quot;</i>, sung by 14 characters using Vocaloid technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no branching routes \u2014 just a single linear story. <br>Choices, where they appear, are light-hearted detours that don't affect the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re free to pause, revisit, or walk away. This is a story that respects your pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0 Special Edition Bonus Content:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 desktop wallpapers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100-image bonus CG collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MP3 + extras for the ending theme song <i>&quot;After School That Couldn\u2019t Become a Constellation&quot;</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> Some bonus files are password-protected. <br>Please right-click the ZIP file and select \u201cExtract All\u201d to avoid repeated password prompts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the <strong>Special Edition</strong> with bonus content. <br>A <strong>Standard Edition</strong> (without bonuses) is also available separately.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~800 full-scene illustrations (generated via KlingAI)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices are non-branching, optional side content only</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~300 ambient and sound effect files, no BGM</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ending theme performed by 14 characters using Voisona</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: ~10 hours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Created with:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ren\u2019Py (Engine)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KlingAI (Visuals)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voisona (Voice synthesis)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cakewalk by BandLab (Music)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer:</strong> Shoichi Kirishima</p></li></ul>",
